# Docker build context for apps/api/Dockerfile (context = repository root). Secrets and local demo state never enter
# an image: every .env file, the clean-room state, the CRE workflow folder (its .env holds the Vault DON secret values)
# and local tooling are excluded. Management-owner keys (~/.catenor-one/) are outside the context altogether.
.git
.github
.agents
.claude
.mcp.json
skills-lock.json
**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*
.catenor-demo
scratch
workflows
artifacts
contracts
docs
slices
tests
coverage
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.DS_Store
apps/api/src/infrastructure/persistence/prisma/generated
apps/web/.next
